From: Arbion Halili <a.halili@protonmail.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 02:43:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] feat(castore): model declared tree metadata

Model filesystem metadata as a line-oriented declaration file inside the tree,
with base64 `user.*` attributes and internal `snix.*` policies for relative
paths. Derive subtree identities from declarations so consumers do not merge
nodes carrying different metadata.

Change-Id: I68a7c82759bcbc94738fa2e4a5adfa9cc2051bc0
